{"671640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Deadburg", "steam_appid": 671640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "The Xbox 360 Indie hit is now coming to PC!<br><br>Deadburg is a co-op survival game set in a procedurally generated city with thousands of buildings to explore and zombies to kill. Every building you see can be explored, exploited and destroyed one block at a time. Play alone or with friends and discover the secrets of the city while you craft items, find supplies and learn new skills.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>WORLD</strong> - A large procedurally generated city awaits you, filled with zombies and loot.  Every block can be broken, you can build a building or raze one to the ground.<br></li><li> <strong>MULTIPLAYER</strong> - Play alone or with up to 3 friends.<br></li><li> <strong>GAME MODES</strong> - Multiple game modes to tailor your zombie survival experience.<br></li><li> <strong>DIFFICULTIES </strong>- Multiple difficulties to make the zombies more threatening if you feel you're up to it.<br></li><li> <strong>CRAFTING</strong>- Craft weapons and supplies to utilize against the zombie menace.  <br></li><li> <strong>BASE BUILDING</strong> - Build a 100% custom building, or modify an existing structure.  Full terrain editing means you can make whatever base you want.<br></li><li> <strong>CHARACTER </strong>- As you survive your character will become stronger, unlocking additional bonuses and skills.  </li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME MODES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>SURVIVAL </strong>- The base survival game.  Kill zombies, scavenge loot, craft weapons, build a base.<br></li><li> <strong>DEFENSE </strong>- Surviving just got a little harder.  The horde will come for you, best you be prepared.<br></li><li> <strong>LAST LIFE</strong> - Survival means little if there isn't a penalty for death.  If your character dies in Last Life it's game over.<br></li><